---
type:       "job"
name:       "packages"
interface:  "python"
script:     "main.py"

# Weight calibrated against measured wall-clock: ~2 min for the yay
# install of the Default Apps selection on fast hardware + fast
# internet. Settings.conf uses a 1 weight unit ≈ 6 seconds scale
# (minutes × 10) — 20 keeps this step's slice in proportion with the
# other 2-minute steps (unpackfs, dotfiles, postinstall).
weight:     20
